## Copy to `.env` and fill in values.
##
## OpenWeatherMap tile API key (free tier).
## Create one at https://home.openweathermap.org/api_keys
VITE_OPENWEATHER_KEY=
# Optional: equirectangular star panorama (2:1) for the background sky texture.
# Must be CORS-accessible for WebGL. Example:
# VITE_SKY_TEXTURE_URL=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/mrdoob/three.js@r165/examples/textures/2294472375_24a3b8ef46_o.jpg
